Z||000025||drednot||06-12-2001||07:47 AM||||If you want to talk 1/4 mile times Jaei Sun, we can do that.  Here is a nice Mopar site for ya.  I posted a little sample of the site for you.  I just love Plymouth Reliants that can go 0-60 in 3.9 seconds!<BR> <A HREF="http://members.nbci.com/minimopar/shelbydodge/" TARGET=_blank>http://members.nbci.com/minimopar/shelbydodge/</A> <P><BR> <A HREF="http://www.jeepenthusiast.com/COM/1999/car_of_the_month_1999_september.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.jeepenthusiast.com/COM/1999/car_of_the_month_1999_september.htm</A> <P>Gary Donovan's 1985 Plymouth Reliant K - 2.5L Turbo II <BR>1/4 mile of 10.86sec @ 127mph on 8/11/00 at Cecil County Street Night (726k) - 1.74 S.T. <BR>1/4 mile of 10.97sec @ 127mph on 8/12/00 at Cecil County Import Battle (706k) - round 2 <BR>1/4 mile of 10.98sec @ 126mph on 8/11/00 at Cecil County Street Night (977k) - 1.82 S.T. (1st pass in the 10s) <BR>1/4 mile of 11.24sec @ 125mph on 8/12/00 at Cecil County Import Battle (714k) - vs Steve Menegon (qualifying) <BR>1/4 mile of 11.26sec @ 125mph on 8/2/00 at Englishtown Dragway (1,191k) <BR>1/4 mile of 11.71sec @ 113mph on 4/29/00 at Atco Import Battle (784k) - vs Ed Bergenholtz <BR>1/4 mile of 12.37sec @ 108.7mph on 9/29/99 at Atco (812k) <BR>1/4 mile of 12.62sec @ 105mph on 7/31/99 at Cecil County Dragstrip (567k) - vs Steve Menegon <BR>1/4 mile of 12.72sec @ 105mph on 7/31/99 at Cecil County Dragstrip (561k) - vs Mike Demoss <BR>1/4 mile of 12.89sec @ 105mph on 7/31/99 at Cecil County Dragstrip (550k) <BR>1/4 mile of 12.91sec @ 101mph on 7/31/99 at Cecil County Dragstrip (582k) <BR>1/4 mile in the low 14s on 4/97 at Epping Dragway Street Night - DOT tires (673k) <BR>1/4 mile in the low 14s on 4/97 at Epping Dragway Street Night - DOT tires (870k)<P><BR>As for you Galen, you are just an ass hole. <P>||||reg||6
