Z||000030||fierogt88||06-12-2001||04:36 PM||||I will back up dannyboy also.  That is a fast fast fast fast fast car.  Yes, it _is_ modified with bigger turbos and lord knows what else.  It will hang with (easily), and beat a (stock) C5.  Maybe not a Z06 but definately a C5.  I would love to see any naysayers show up in a C5 trying to disprove it, 'cuz I could use a good laugh! HaHa! When I drove it I wasn't used to the shift points or anything and I had every confidence that I could out-run and out-handle anything around.  I hit 110 entering the highway and it felt like 55.<P>Sure, there are people who will make exagerated claims about what their cars can do, but danny can back it up.  The stealth is sweet. 'nuff said.||||reg||1
