Z||000033||ThatRickGuy||06-12-2001||04:55 PM||||Good call stimpy! I was thinking about either a 3000gt or an Eagle Talon, it's really too bad the sporty 4 wheel drive cars all got discontinued. Being a Wisconsin native, I was really hoping for a new one so I could keep the fiero as a summer car. <P>But never, ever, ever! under any circumstances, say that it can not be done! I've seen classic mustangs with poncho power, old GTO's with bow ties under the hood, I've even seen a POS 80's gm hatch back run a 1/4 in 12 sec before torquing the frame. It is possible to make almost any car out accelerate a vette. Enough money, Mechanical skills, and McGuyvering, and it'll work, maybe only once, but it'll work.<P>And give up on the stupid car insults. gad, you guys were making this look like a honda civic forum (not to rip on civics, more so the large number of immature people who post on their forums.)<BR>||||reg||1
