Z||000043||TRiAD||06-13-2001||08:17 PM||||<BR>You know what? Let's end this right now...<P>  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by danny boy:<BR><B> Got mine for $9000. '91 Stealth AWD T/T, fully loaded w/ 97K miles but a new engine. Right now with the very few things I've done And for under $13K I can smoke a C5.  <BR> *<BR>BTW, drednot, go **** yourself. Come back when you're not a moron. <P><BR>...This car was a little over 43K brand new.<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>R&T magazine, 5-91 issue, tested a '91 Stealth R/T Turbo.<BR>PRICE NEW; $30,534. (nowhere NEAR "over $43K", as claimed)<BR>HP; 300. NOT 320 (as someone here said)<BR>0-60 stock; 6.0sec. / 6.3 for the Mitsu (Nowhere NEAR 4.3sec!) Quick, but nothing special. <P>...if you found a way to drop 1.7sec from your 0-60 time (6.0 down to 4.3) for $4K ($9K on the car, $13K after mods, as claimed), you had better market it...you'll be a millionaire!<P>BTW, the 600+hp, $283,750.00 Vector W8 Twin Turbo (yeah, the one built on an aluminum honeycomb and carbon/kevlar tub, just like the McLaren F1 GTR and current LM and F1 cars) ran 0-60 in 4.2...just to add a car that you "can run with". <P>Again, run her this weekend, get a verifiable slip, and post it. I will be the FIRST to shake your hand and apologize.<p>[This message has been edited by TRiAD (edited 06-13-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000044||BV MotorSports||06-13-2001||11:50 PM||||Hee hee hee. Got Rice? Does this mean that 2 of the cars in my sig are RiCers? Even if 1<BR>is completely stock (well boost is up to 14.5 from 7.5 stock) and the other has some mods and (head hung low) 1 sticker? It says Turbo inside (made like the intel inside decal).<P>Damn...<BR>Own a 94 Firebird WS6<BR>87 Fiero GT<BR>87 Chrysler Conquest TSi<BR>85.5 Starion ESi (rarest of the StarQuests)<P>Honda guys hate me<BR>Corvette guys hate me<BR>Mustang guys hate me<BR>DSM guys hate me<BR>LS1 guys talk trash to us lowly LT1 owners<BR>and the list continues.<P>Cant we all just get along? Am I a ricer since I own a Mitsubishi? But if I was wouldnt owning a 12sec Firebird make me a ???<P>WHo knows! The way I see it, your in good company if the "other guys" use your type of car as a benchmark. IE Hey I just out ran a 5.0! <BR>5.0 known to be a quick car. Get my meaning?<P>Steven (confused ameri-rice owner)<P>------------------<BR>87 Fiero GT 14.9/ 93mph<BR>94 Formula WS6 w/ NOS 12.4 /118mph<BR>87 Conquest TSi <BR>85.5 Starion ESi||||reg||12
