Z||000046||BV MotorSports||06-14-2001||12:18 AM||||Dunno where you live but next week I will be finishing my v8 swap! Yep, I put a small block chevy into an 87 Conquest TSi. Wasnt that hard to do. Got some crap from some of the die hard StarQuest owners but then I said, Did you pay for it or own the car?<P>So far I have recieved 100 e-mails asking me to make a "kit". I dont have time for that but if my buddy JR in FL would help.....HMMM!<P>Hee hee hee this car is gonna rock! LT1, 6 speed Conquest!<P>See what kinda stuff happens when you have 4 days off each week? Doh! So what is a v8 powered 'Quest? Is it a Ricer?<P>Steven<P>------------------<BR>87 Fiero GT 14.9/ 93mph<BR>94 Formula WS6 w/ NOS 12.4 /118mph<BR>87 Conquest TSi <BR>85.5 Starion ESi||||reg||1
