Z||000068||TRiAD||06-16-2001||03:47 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by danny boy:<BR><B> For the last time, I RACED A 2000 CORVETTE AND WON.END OF STORY. <BR> <P>[This message has been edited by danny boy (edited 06-15-2001).]</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>No problem. <BR>You should have said it that way the first time.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>I beat a C4 'Vette in my '97 GTI VR6 once. <BR>It was an auto, and the kid didn't know how to drive. It can happen to/for any of us. <BR>Course, I never went around saying "I can smoke C4s"...<P>Have a good one!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>||||reg||6
